    excerpt: "Real estate has long been India's favourite investment. But solar assets are challenging that dominance with higher yields, lower hassle, and a green tailwind. Here's the full comparison.",
    category: "Investment Guide",
    tags: ["solar vs real estate", "solar investment India", "alternative investments India", "real estate vs solar returns", "best investment India 2024"],
